The following files are substantially or entirely that upstream's original work and
are NOT covered by the MIT license above:

  backend/app/twelvelabs_client.py   285 lines, unmodified from upstream
  data/ontology.yaml                 152 lines, 7 modified
  backend/scripts/ingest.py          386 lines, ~75% upstream
  frontend/components/VideoBrowser.tsx  derived from upstream, since largely rewritten

