this repository rather than republished.

To be plain about what this means: this repository as a whole cannot currently be
relicensed, and a downstream user cannot rely on the MIT grant for those four files.
Upstream has been asked to add one:
https://github.com/jpadams/video-context-graph/issues/2
If and when a license appears there, this section will be updated or removed.

If you need a cleanly licensed derivative before then, the delta layer in section 1
does not depend on section 3 except through backend/scripts/ingest.py (video
ingestion) and backend/app/twelvelabs_client.py (the TwelveLabs API wrapper); both
are replaceable.

